// DK_LED-RXCARD_GW3A-LV20UG324S_V2.1: ethernet_hub75 pins (DBUG1298-1.0).
// PHY1 = U43 (RGMII). HUB75 J4..J11 (tables 3-6..3-13): R1 G1 B1 R2 G2 B2 of each;
// group 1 control (J4..J11): A A7, B C7, C E6, D A8, E C8, CLK D6, LAT E7, OE B8.
// HUB75 J12..J19 (tables 3-14..3-21), group 2 control: A R8, B T8, C N8,
// D P8, E U8, CLK T5, LAT T6, OE V8. All banks used here are 3.3 V except the DDR2
// banks 2 / 3 (1.8 V).
